    "blurb": "Deliver live, governed enterprise data & context for AI process automation",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda process orchestration with the Denodo Platform via Model Context Protocol (MCP). Enable secure, governed data retrieval across enterprise sources to power intelligent processes.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "The AI Data Layer: Live, Governed Data + Active Context for Enterprise Processes",
    "splashDescription": "Denodo provides the AI Data Layer that delivers live, governed enterprise data together with active context—a continuously available, semantically unified view of distributed data and its business meaning—without requiring data to be consolidated into another platform first.\n\nThe Denodo MCP Connector connects process steps, automated rules, human task workers, and AI agents directly to the Denodo Platform using the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Through zero-copy data virtualization across 200+ enterprise sources, Denodo streams context-rich, business-meaningful data products directly into workflows while centrally enforcing zero-trust security, row/column-level access control, and lineage at query execution. By serving real-time logical views that reflect operational state changes instantly, Denodo eliminates duplicated point-to-point integrations and ensures every process step acts on trusted, consistent, and authorized enterprise context.\n\nBy providing a single, governed abstraction layer over all enterprise data, Denodo eliminates duplicate integrations, lowers maintenance overhead, and ensures data consistency across all automated, human-in-the-loop, and agentic workflows.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/872599/overview/img1772169406326515298.png?a0b058fd21d9127087978dbe26acf7b5",
